{'symbol': 'MMC', 'date': '2023-05-30 02:00:00', 'title': "MARSH MCLENNAN'S GUY CARPENTER TO ACQUIRE RE SOLUTIONS, ISRAEL'S LEADING REINSURANCE BROKER", 'text': 'TEL AVIV, ISRAEL--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GUY CARPENTER, A BUSINESS OF MARSH MCLENNAN (NYSE: MMC) AND THE LEADING GLOBAL RISK AND REINSURANCE SPECIALIST, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS TO ACQUIRE RE SOLUTIONS, THE LEADING INDEPENDENT REINSURANCE BROKER IN ISRAEL. TERMS OF THE TRANSACTION, WHICH IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE LATER THIS QUARTER, WERE NOT DISCLOSED. FOUNDED IN 2010, RE SOLUTIONS COMBINES INDUSTRY EXPERIENCE WITH SOPHISTICATED ACTUARIAL AND ANALYTICS CAPABILITIES, TOGETHER WITH A STRONG REPUTATION FOR.'}